        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 3250  Aluminum Modern Door Pull.</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis incredible Modern design door pull can be used in many applications such as:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Appliances, such as Refrigerators and Freezers</li>\r\n<li>Entrance and Patio Doors</li>\r\n<li>Glass Shower Door Pulls</li>\r\n<li>Furniture, such as Armoires and Cabinets</li>\r\n<li>Just about anywhere a door pull is needed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis new contemporary rectangular door pull was designed by First Impressions International, the leader in innovative pull concepts. \r\n<br>It is available in you choice of <b>Polished Chrome or Satin Nickel</b> finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions 3250  Modern Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Non-Rusting Solid Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available  standard lengths </b> for First Impressions 3250  Modern Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-3250-300 - Total Length 11-7/8\", Center to Center Mount - 8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-3250-500 - Total Length 19-5/8\", Center to Center Mount - 15-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts through the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**Item is Discontinued</b> Use <a href=\"/products/sutter-rectangular-satin-stainless-steel-door-pull-first-impressions-str6smtss4bss\"><b>Rectangular Door Pull</b></a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>***Item is Discontinued</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
